{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S08把暂时搁置回去写成了“却没想回头”，与后面仍然犹豫、期待回去的心理不够连贯；S09又把想有人陪伴推成了愿意重新忍受那些委屈，动机解释略显过重。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X更适合边听边扫，重点句有明确的视觉锚点，感受提示按照音乐段落拆开出现，不必一次消化大量并列词语。它对音色、节奏、力度和身体感受的描写也更具体细腻，普通观众更容易把文字和正在听到的音乐联系起来。不过，Y在人物动机的克制表达和前后心理逻辑上更稳，X偶尔为了强化表达而替人物作了过于确定的心理判断。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "6acbae22-1965-4798-9325-48fc9e90dd83", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T231400505530Z", "elapsed_seconds": 65.485, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T23:15:05.998621+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "42becdca88d20a5538b6b1fba82548683c1f6c072a59ec76035742a2dca18598", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_att